---
description: Mandatory documentation maintenance for all APP-SPJ changes
alwaysApply: true
---

Before editing APP-SPJ, read:

- `AGENTS.md`
- `.ai/rules/index.md`
- `docs/README.md`
- `docs/DOCUMENTATION_MAINTENANCE.md`
- `docs/CURRENT_PROGRESS.md`
- `docs/DEVELOPMENT_ROADMAP.md`

Before completing any task, perform the Documentation Impact Review defined in `docs/DOCUMENTATION_MAINTENANCE.md`.

Do not hard-code the current project priority in this rule. Derive active status and priority from `docs/CURRENT_PROGRESS.md` and `docs/DEVELOPMENT_ROADMAP.md`.

If behavior, architecture, workflow, verification evidence, or release status changes, update the impacted docs in the same change. Stale documentation is a defect. Never claim PASS/verified without actual evidence.
